# RESETIUS | Dragon&med { ; William McWorter
# RESETIUS |   Angle 8
# RESETIUS |   Axiom -c32X+[+++@.5gw---c40@q2fz]+c48y
# RESETIUS |   F=
# RESETIUS |   g=
# RESETIUS |   X=fx+[+++@.5gw---c40@q2fz]+fy
# RESETIUS |   Y=Fx-[---@.5gw+++c40@q2fz]-fy
# RESETIUS |   z=fz
# RESETIUS |   w=gw
# RESETIUS |   }
